{"id":"asi_","lemma":"así","pos":"adv","rank":44,"glosses":["like this; like that; as such; thus; so; thereby; this way, that way","used to express wishes of misfortune against someone, or to cast a spell"],"ipa":"/aˈsi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-as%C3%AD.wav","examples":[{"text":"Así es la vida.","en":"That's life.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438577"},{"text":"Yo también pienso así.","en":"We think alike.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427982"},{"text":"Los niños son así.","en":"Kids will be kids.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443453"},{"text":"Así es como fue.","en":"That's how it was.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448274"},{"text":"Así es como era.","en":"That's how it was.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448275"}]}